There are 115 shaders implemented by this one set of main source files. For
this operations there are done on the component floats with the corresponding
component on the second argument. The variants which end with FA use a single
float to represent all of the components in the second argument.

ND_<op>_<variant>

                                             OP
VARIANT    |add subtract multiply divide modulo atan2 power safepower min max
